 "Assign": "分配",
 "<b>How tokens work.</b> Every class and default beast has a figure. Every <b>custom character</b> gets one automatically from its portrait (Creator Studio → Characters), and every <b>custom beast</b> wears the figure of its kind (a ready-made animal, or one drawn automatically for a custom kind) — pick either in <i>Token for</i> to sculpt it. You can also sculpt <b>free-standing library tokens</b> (📚 below) and hand them to any creation, here or from the character and beast editors. Tokens show on the board when Settings → Tokens is on <b>Figures</b>; your creations always wear theirs. {0}": "<b>标记如何运作。</b>每个职业和默认野兽都有一个形象。每个<b>自定义角色</b>都会根据其肖像自动获得一个（创作工坊 → 角色），每头<b>自定义野兽</b>都使用其种类的形象（现成的动物，或为自定义种类自动绘制的形象）——在<i>标记对象</i>中选择任一项即可雕塑它。你也可以雕塑<b>独立的库中标记</b>（下方📚），并在这里或角色与野兽编辑器中把它交给任何创作。当设置 → 标记为<b>人像</b>时，标记会显示在棋盘上；你的创作总会使用自己的标记。{0}",
